        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Belief that someone enters the house and moves belongings"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For the last 4–6 weeks, reports a fixed belief that a man comes into the house at night and moves things; says, “I’m sure someone’s been in, my knitting wasn’t where I left it.” Doors are locked and there is no evidence of entry. Patient says it may be her mind playing tricks but it feels real."
      }
